ativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/deed.en","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Karantika_Algerian.jpg"}},"ingredient/rastrelliger-kanagurta":{"t":"ingredient","r":"ingredient/rastrelliger-kanagurta","n":"Rastrelliger kanagurta","c":"#c9b8dd","crumb":[["Ingredients","ingredients"]],"sub":"Ingredient in 1 dish across 1 cuisine","intro":[["The Indian mackerel or bigmouth mackerel (Rastrelliger kanagurta) is a species of mackerel in the family Scombridae. It is commonly found in the Indian and West"]],"src":"wikipedia","actions":[{"kind":"globe","hash":"ingredient-rastrelliger-kanagurta"},{"kind":"wiki","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rastrelliger_kanagurta"}],"sections":[{"h":"Where it's cooked with","count":1,"groups":[["Malay cuisine","cuisine/malay-cuisine",[["Lekor","dish/lekor"]]]]},{"h":"Often cooked with","links":[["Fish","ingredient/fish"],["Round sardinella","ingredient/round-sardinella"],["Sago","ingredient/sago"],["Silver-stripe round herring","ingredient/silver-stripe-round-herring"],["Tapioca starch","ingredient/tapioca-starch"]]}],"img":{"src":"/labs/cuisines/img/thumb/4/41/Rastrelliger_kanagurta_JNC2855.JPG/500px-Rastrelliger_kanagurta_JNC2855.JPG","w":500,"h":245,"by":"Jean-Lou Justine","lic":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Rastrelliger_kanagurta_JNC2855.JPG"}},"dish/mille-feuille":{"t":"dish","r":"dish/mille-feuille","n":"Mille-feuille","c":"#ede6da","crumb":[["Dishes","dishes"]],"sub":"Dish found in 2 cuisines","dot":"#cf5f87","intro":[["A mille-feuille, also known as Napoleon in Russia and other post-Soviet states, as well as in North America, vanilla slice and custard slice in the United Kingdom, as well as Australia and New Zealand, is a French dessert made of puff pastry layered with pastry cream. Its modern form was influenced by improvements made by Marie-Antoine Carême."]],"src":"wikipedia","actions":[{"kind":"globe","hash":"dish-mille-feuille"},{"kind":"wiki","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mille-feuille"}],"sections":[{"h":"Where it's from","links":[["French cuisine","cuisine/french-cuisine"],["New Caledonian cuisine","cuisine/new-caledonian-cuisine"]]},{"h":"Ingredients","count":4,"links":[["Custard","ingredient/custard"],["Fondant","ingredient/fondant"],["Powdered sugar","ingredient/powdered-sugar"],["Puff pastry","ingredient/puff-pastry"]]},{"h":"Cook it","rows":[{"name":"Pardon Your French","color":"#55b8ad","shape":"site","sub":"pardonyourfrench.com","note":"Audrey Le Goff, a French cook, shares classic and regional French home recipes.","url":"https://pardonyourfrench.com","suggested":true,"kind":"blog"},{"name":"La Cuisine de Géraldine","color":"#55b8ad","shape":"site","sub":"lacuisinedegeraldine.fr","note":"French home cooking blog by Géraldine Leverd, also author of The New French Kitchen.","url":"https://lacuisinedegeraldine.fr/en/about-us","suggested":true,"kind":"blog"},{"name":"New Caledonia Tourism: Kanak cooking","color":"#55b8ad","shape":"site","sub":"newcaledonia.travel","note":"Official tourism board overview of Kanak food, including bougna cooked in an earth oven.","url":"https://www.newcaledonia.travel/nz/gastronomy-wine/gastronomy/kanak-cooking","suggested":true,"kind":"site"}]},{"h":"More from French cuisine","links":[["Adventureland Bazaar","dish/adventureland-bazaar"],["Albufera sauce","dish/albufera-sauce"],["Andouillette","dish/andouillette"],["Aspic","dish/aspic"],["Bayonne ham","dish/bayonne-ham"],["Beef Stroganoff","dish/beef-stroganoff"],["Beurre maître d'hôtel","dish/beurre-maitre-d-hotel"],["Beurre manié","dish/beurre-manie"],["Bisque (food)","dish/bisque-food"],["Blanquette de veau","dish/blanquette-de-veau"],["Blini","dish/blini"],["Bolinhos de bacalhau","dish/bolinhos-de-bacalhau"],["Bouillabaisse","dish/bouillabaisse"],["Bourride","dish/bourride"],["Brioche","dish/brioche"],["Cabbage roll","dish/cabbage-roll"],["Calisson","dish/calisson"],["Canapé","dish